sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Protect as protect middleware
    participant Router as groupRoutes.js
    participant DB as MongoDB Group

    Client->>Protect: GET /api/groups/ Bearer token
    Protect->>DB: User.findById(decoded.id)
    DB-->>Protect: user
    Protect->>Router: next() req.user set
    Router->>DB: Group.find() populate admin and members
    DB-->>Router: groups array
    Router-->>Client: 200 groups array

    Note over Protect,Client: If token missing or invalid, protect returns 401 Not authorized
